{{!
    Stacked rows rather than a table.

    This was a four-column table, which cannot be read on a phone: clients either scroll it
    sideways or squeeze the columns until every cell wraps to one word per line.

    Structural styling is inline rather than in the layout's stylesheet. Several clients strip
    <style> — Gmail's mobile app does for non-Gmail accounts — and an inlined row still reads
    correctly when that happens. The class names are kept so the layout's dark-mode block can
    still reach these elements; those rules carry !important because a stylesheet cannot
    otherwise beat an inline style.

    Expired and expiring-soon are separate sections rather than a coloured word in a Status
    column. Colour alone excludes anyone who cannot distinguish it and is stripped by several
    clients; grouping survives both, and puts what needs acting on today first.
}}
<h2>{{Title}}</h2>
<p>{{Summary}}</p>

{{#HasExpired}}
<div class="section-heading warning" style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin:24px 0 4px;color:#d32f2f;">Already expired</div>
{{#ExpiredItems}}
<div class="item" style="padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;">
    <div class="item-name" style="font-weight:500;font-size:16px;">{{ProductName}}{{QuantitySuffix}}</div>
    <div class="item-meta" style="font-size:14px;color:#666666;margin-top:2px;">{{RelativeExpiry}} &middot; {{LocationName}}</div>
</div>
{{/ExpiredItems}}
{{/HasExpired}}

{{#HasExpiringSoon}}
<div class="section-heading" style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin:24px 0 4px;">Expiring soon</div>
{{#ExpiringSoonItems}}
<div class="item" style="padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0;">
    <div class="item-name" style="font-weight:500;font-size:16px;">{{ProductName}}{{QuantitySuffix}}</div>
    <div class="item-meta" style="font-size:14px;color:#666666;margin-top:2px;">{{RelativeExpiry}} &middot; {{LocationName}}</div>
</div>
{{/ExpiringSoonItems}}
{{/HasExpiringSoon}}

{{#DeepLinkUrl}}<a href="{{BaseUrl}}{{DeepLinkUrl}}" class="button" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;background-color:#518751;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;margin:20px 0;font-size:15px;">View Inventory</a>{{/DeepLinkUrl}}
